{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The run observed the mismatch at both boundaries. Node 2 submitted `1101:30`, but its response and `ReadyToRead` carried node 3’s `2202:30`. Each origin had one release, one response, and one readiness event; the generated-message queue was drained.\n\nThe later request retained its correct context. The evidence supports the earlier request’s correlation defect, without establishing a stale application read or an unbounded stall.\n"}}
